msgstr "a modell mezőinek listája egy :class:`~odoo.fields.One2many` kapcsolaton keresztül a :ref:`reference/webservice/inspection/fields` hivatkozásra"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:1115
msgid ":class:`~odoo.fields.One2many` to the :doc:`../reference/user_interface/view_architectures` defined for the model"
msgstr ":class:`~odoo.fields.One2many` kapcsolat a modellhez definiált :doc:`../reference/user_interface/view_architectures` nézetekhez"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:1119
msgid "``access_ids``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:1118
