msgstr "`Példa: useTooltip használata a Kaban-ban <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/0e6481f359e2e4dd4f5b5147a1754bb3cca57311/addons/web/static/src/views/kanban/kanban_record.js#L189-L192>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/master_odoo_web_framework/02_create_gallery_view.rst:461
